左逆、右逆的构造.md","sha256":"ebaf3245cc6e5318191b2b97b9dae12abde28bbf0181646994ec541d06e778fc"}],"text":"# 矩形矩阵左逆、右逆的构造\n\n本页是由五份讲义来源提炼的通用知识锚点，不含本人作答证据；关联题只表示知识点归属，不推断错因、掌握度或复习状态。\n\n## 范围\n\n从AB=I等条件判断满秩方向，把未知逆的各列还原成非齐次系统并给参数解。\n\n## 条件与边界\n\n矩形单侧逆不保证另一侧乘积也是单位阵；非唯一时不能强行给唯一“逆矩阵”。\n\n## 来源\n\n| 来源 | 文件 | PDF页 | 书内页 | 定位短语 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| L880 | 【A4紧凑版】880数一线概篇做题本.pdf | 22 | 21 | 单位矩阵 |\n| L880 | 【A4紧凑版】880数一线概篇做题本.pdf | 28 | 27 | 矩阵 |\n\n## 上级知识节点\n\n- 逆矩阵（候选上级，未作为已接受的 is-a 边）\n- 线性方程组（候选上级，未作为已接受的 is-a 边）\n\n## 知识关系（提案，未生效）\n\n暂无关系提案。\n\n## 关联正式题\n\n暂无关联正式题。\n\n## 来源标识\n\n- 参考包运行标识：`A-math-anchor-distribution-20260909-01`\n- 包内定位：`LA06.12`（仅用于本包定位，不是本地正式 ID）\n- 来源范围：`main`；锚点类型：`knowledge`"},"source:8ad48009560cc1dbbe0a7be0":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":["变力做功积分","定积分"],"metadata":{"coverage":"full_bytes","image_semantic_reviewed":false,"original_path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-415/question_01.png","original_sha256":"3c126a60b8bd1ccc77b89becbcdf0818051521ba620e6055978a26ac6748d4ab","personal_evidence":false,"role":"reference_only_not_mastery","size":78518,"status":"verified","text_status":"text_unavailable_no_ocr"},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:8ad48009560cc1dbbe0a7be0","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/0b61ef99eb930e1a0d0e24d37c30b0ffdecd386d821dc41013f544cbc240a9d8.json","sha256":"c3cdca5a292ba627e2a3c8189cfbf2956d4376bf1137acaeb98095f3e8692a3f"},{"path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-415/question_01.png","sha256":"3c126a60b8bd1ccc77b89becbcdf0818051521ba620e6055978a26ac6748d4ab"}],"text":""},"source:b20c47f9a4872e909e26bd16":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":["圆锥面","多元函数积分学","旋转曲面","曲面定向","有向投影面积","第二型曲面积分"],"metadata":{"coverage":"full_bytes","image_semantic_reviewed":false,"original_path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS